{"task":"transcribe","language":"english","duration":24.65999984741211,"text":"A small black vessel with a procession carved right around it, men coming back from work with tools over their shoulders, and in front of them some who are singing. One has his mouth wide open and his chest pushed out, and you can see plainly that he is shouting the words. It is rare in ancient art to be able to see sound. The faces are not identical either. One is laughing, another has had enough.","words":[{"word":"A","start":0,"end":0.3799999952316284},{"word":"small","start":0.3799999952316284,"end":0.7400000095367432},{"word":"black","start":0.7400000095367432,"end":1.0800000429153442},{"word":"vessel","start":1.0800000429153442,"end":1.3799999952316284},{"word":"with","start":1.3799999952316284,"end":1.7000000476837158},{"word":"a","start":1.7000000476837158,"end":2},{"word":"procession","start":2,"end":2.440000057220459},{"word":"carved","start":2.440000057220459,"end":2.680000066757202},{"word":"right","start":2.680000066757202,"end":3},{"word":"around","start":3,"end":3.2200000286102295},{"word":"it","start":3.2200000286102295,"end":3.5199999809265137},{"word":"men","start":4.159999847412109,"end":4.239999771118164},{"word":"coming","start":4.239999771118164,"end":4.519999980926514},{"word":"back","start":4.519999980926514,"end":4.78000020980835},{"word":"from","start":4.78000020980835,"end":5},{"word":"work","start":5,"end":5.260000228881836},{"word":"with","start":5.260000228881836,"end":5.539999961853027},{"word":"tools","start":5.539999961853027,"end":5.840000152587891},{"word":"over","start":5.840000152587891,"end":6.039999961853027},{"word":"their","start":6.039999961853027,"end":6.639999866485596},{"word":"shoulders","start":6.639999866485596,"end":6.639999866485596},{"word":"and","start":7.139999866485596,"end":7.28000020980835},{"word":"in","start":7.28000020980835,"end":7.579999923706055},{"word":"front","start":7.579999923706055,"end":7.579999923706055},{"word":"of","s